OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 turn out for data
OL,4,Acentre meeting amid concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 people attended a
OL,7,Fconsultation on plans to build a large
OL,8,Fdata centre on green belt land in
OL,9,FCheshire.
OL,11,FInnova held the drop-in session at High
OL,12,FLegh Village Hall near Lymm on
OL,13,FWednesday evening to discuss plans to
OL,14,Fbuild a 60-hectare data centre in
OL,15,FLittle Bollington.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
