OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 turn out for data
OL,4,Acentre meeting amid concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal resident Mike Reed, who is
OL,7,Fhelping to organise local opposition to
OL,8,Fthe plan, described it as a "massive
OL,9,Fgreat industrial monster" and said
OL,10,Flocals left the meeting with "deep
OL,11,Fanxiety" over the potential impact on
OL,12,Ftheir homes, businesses and wildlife.
OL,14,FThe company said it was "pleased with
OL,15,Fthe turnout" and "grateful to local
OL,16,Fresidents for providing valuable
OL,17,Ffeedback".
